## Day 113 Session Plan (19:31)

### Task 1: Wire skills into sub-agents via `SubAgentTool::with_skills` (Issue #518)
• Files: `src/tools.rs`
• What: Add .with_skills(config.skills.clone()) to `build_sub_agent_tool()` builder chain — one-line fix
• Why: Sub-agents currently don't receive the SkillSet, so the research skill never reaches dispatched sub-agents. They answer from training memory instead of using web_search. This completes the Exa migration.

### Task 2: Add test-coverage signal to `/risk` scorer (Dream milestone)
• Files: `src/commands_info.rs`
• What: Add test_density (tests-per-100-lines) to FileRisk, incorporate it into risk scoring, display in reports
• Why: Advances the dream milestone — predicting which files will break. Test density is the first signal beyond "big + recently changed" → "big + recently changed + under-tested." Makes /risk a genuine self-diagnostic.

### Task 3: Graceful `EXA_API_KEY` missing warning (Issue #517)
• Files: src/tools.rs, src/banner.rs
• What: Show a startup warning when `EXA_API_KEY` is not set; improve the error message at call time. Close #517.
• Why: Users currently discover the Exa requirement mid-conversation when web_search fails. A proactive warning at startup is better UX.
